Either way $|ab-cd|=|6\cdot3-0\cdot5|=\boxed{18}$.

In triangle $BPC$, $\angle BPC=180^\circ-\angle PBC-\angle PCB$. Since $P$ is inside the triangle,
\[
\angle PBC=\angle ABC-20^\circ,\qquad \angle PCB=\angle ACB-15^\circ .
\]

\begin{asy}
